{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52332","headline":"诗（幷序） 九十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 九十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我家在何处，结对（张改作「队」）守先阿（戴校「结草守山阿」、项校「结宇对山阿」）。\n[院]（𨺋）侧狐狸窟，门前乌鹊窠\n闻[莺]（应）便下种，听雁即收禾。\n闷遣奴吹笛，闲令如其唱歌。\n如（郑振铎改「男」，项云通「儿」）即教诵赋，女即学调梭。\n寄语天公道，宁能那我何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}